{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "42a37e0c-030b-442d-8a8d-cd8590f0ae53",
      "name": "Synchronizing",
      "description": {
        "content": "Synchronization is explicit and it is up to the integration to call each\nresource in the order deemed appropriate.\n\nWhen calling any synchronization functions. Care must be taken by the\nintegration to not get itself into ping-pong call loop. For instance, if an api\ncall synchronizes a resource, then the webhook handler __should not__ call a\ndifferent resource synchronize function.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
